      "spam": false,
      "value": "TO BE CLEAR:\n\nI have no worries that VRChat will not behave in an ethical manner.\n\nI just think adding this part to the terms would be a way to help put prospective content creators minds at ease if they are worried about the platform using their stuff in ways they do not approve of.\n\nThis will be especially important when an open metaverse someday comes into being on WebVR. We want to be able to point to the terms to reassure people about their work and that they do have control if they wish to remove it.\n\nI also realize promotional, data, research, etc reasons would be exceptions to this clause. This is also true for the other platforms that have it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
